168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (The Automated Duck Egg Sorting System aims to make egg sorting faster and more accurate. Sorting eggs manually takes time and can lead to mistakes. This system uses a camera, color sensor, candling light, and weight scale to classify eggs into three types: red eggs \(salted eggs\), Balut, and Penoy. A conveyor belt moves the eggs, while servo motors adjust a flat surface divider to guide them into their respective sections. An OLED Screen displays the sorting results, making the process efficient and easy to monitor.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
